  "description": "The Tread is a do-it-all, go-anywhere machine. Perfect for the commuter seeking all-weather utility and the ability to off-road explore. Constructed of A6-SL custom-butted alloy that is both strong and lightweight. FC-440 full-carbon fork with flat-mounted disc brake caliper, internal cable routing and hidden fender mounts for added carrying capacity. Tapered head tube with an integrated headset further bolsters front-end stiffness for precise steering. Wide gearing range with a compact crank enables riders to tackle both climbs and flats. Disc brakes provide superior stopping power in all weather conditions. 32mm-wide tires provide greater compliance and stability off-road yet are versatile enough for quick trips in and out of crowded city streets.",
